{
  "id": "Props",
  "name": "Props (杂物)",
  "units": "metres, Z up; angles in degrees (angle sockets are converted when a scene is built)",
  "notes": [
    "Small interactive props that belong to no world: each one is a simulation on a studio tabletop, rendered with EEVEE.",
    "Colours are linear RGB.  In scene data a colour input may name a palette entry instead of giving RGB.",
    "A liquid preset is a Core.physics.liquid material plus the library material its surface renders with.",
    "The studio is put up for every scene: a tabletop (top face z = 0), a cyclorama, a gradient world and three area lights placed at the scene's subject + offset, aimed at it."
